  "headword": "may",
  "ipa": [
    "meɪ"
  ],
  "star": true,
  "levelMark": true,
  "inflections": "（might /maɪt/）",
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "aux.v.",
      "zh": "可以；也许，可能"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "may"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " lose your way if you walk alone in the mountains at night."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "如果晚上你独自一人在山里走，你可能会迷路。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "May"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " I park my car here for a while?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— No, you mustn’t. Do you see the sign “NO PARKING”?"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "——我可以把车停在这里一会儿吗？\n——不，你不能。你看到“禁止停车”的标志吗？"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "may 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握以下用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) may be v. 可能是"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "must be v. 一定是"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "can’t be v. 不可能是（否定猜测用 can’t be；肯定猜测用 may be 和 must be；可能性大用 must be，可能性小用 may be。）"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "maybe (= perhaps) adv. 可能"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) may 引导的一般疑问句的否定回答要用 mustn’t，表示“不允许”“不准”“不行”等意思。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：— "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "May"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " I take this dictionary out of the library?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— No, you mustn’t."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——我可以把这本字典拿出图书馆吗？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——不，不行。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
